{"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"Test 2","w":0.060150375366210929,"h":0.015988372635703185,"c":1,"x":0.87030075207556556,"y":0.052325581098221163},{"y":0.083179829344737,"x":0.073920165809997607,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.058721866607666012,"h":0.016650357710033203},{"w":0.026315789222717281,"t":"JIМ:","y":0.10465116276606312,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1,"x":0.07518797002679925},{"w":0.057244656880696604,"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.017265484399052511,"c":1,"x":0.073842398533589593,"y":0.15360268999554383},{"c":1,"x":0.073308270470164957,"y":0.19186046504258936,"t":"JIM:","w":0.028195489247639982,"h":0.013081395234588733},{"y":0.20713315868257953,"x":0.072447795839583176,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.05637535095214842,"h":0.016062154972545484},{"x":0.073308270373494716,"y":0.22819767438229033,"t":"JIM:","w":0.028195489247639982,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1},{"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.073308269677396745,"y":0.26308139523546537,"h":0.011627907148116901,"c":1,"w":0.054511280059814468},{"x":0.073308270715419843,"w":0.026315789222717295,"c":1,"h":0.011627907148116678,"t":"JIM:","y":0.28197674405563755},{"h":0.012137934383237514,"x":0.073215675727072091,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.33259382340703514,"w":0.052816769282023127},{"c":1,"x":0.071428571554054895,"y":0.35174418584454625,"h":0.011627907148116901,"w":0.026315789222717281,"t":"JIM:"},{"y":0.38643535247246008,"h":0.01201301594357751,"w":0.05464695612589518,"c":1,"x":0.071360732369132401,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"x":0.071428571460069923,"w":0.026315789222717281,"h":0.010174418447559619,"c":1,"t":"JIM:","y":0.40552325585010585},{"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"y":0.44040697663773565,"w":0.052631578445434576,"h":0.011627907148116789,"x":0.071428571585553394},{"w":0.030075187683105478,"h":0.014534883321060788,"t":"JIM:","x":0.069548872323860797,"c":1,"y":0.47238372102634663},{"h":0.019101693717725743,"y":0.077480854141814604,"t":"So how long are the rides?","c":1,"x":0.1500302518362841,"w":0.22630302429199217},{"t":"They're about an hour and a half. So, if you have a job it's easy to fit in before you","x":0.14771416610949606,"w":0.67099472045898434,"y":0.091541185836897965,"h":0.047036779517906302,"c":1},{"y":0.10959672339024273,"w":0.64664347330729166,"c":1,"x":0.14768198852270009,"h":0.046711559995711416,"t":"go to work. And the members often go somewhere for coffee afterwards, so it's"},{"t":"quite a social event.","w":0.16917293548583984,"c":1,"y":0.13361236289952794,"x":0.14849623893990554,"h":0.017707662588538287},{"c":1,"h":0.045493573583638591,"x":0.14772032026971185,"y":0.14433298611979728,"t":"OK. That sounds good. I've only just moved to the city so I don't actually know","w":0.64085449218750001},{"t":"many people yet.","y":0.16860465130568125,"w":0.14285714467366536,"h":0.015988371407532842,"x":0.14849624016316729,"c":1},{"y":0.18453356257037579,"c":1,"x":0.14605822964039988,"w":0.31319320678710938,"t":"Well, it's a great way to meet people.","h":0.025014797488259854},{"y":0.20249142572348588,"h":0.021797909708999419,"w":0.30139254252115888,"c":1,"x":0.14442385098956928,"t":"And does each ride have a leader?"},{"h":0.04298759504663352,"t":"Sometimes, but not always. But you don't really need one; the group members on","y":0.21676586511295948,"w":0.66700968424479168,"c":1,"x":0.14595048975004166},{"t":"the ride support one another, anyway.","y":0.23577464844187934,"c":1,"x":0.14600617899187532,"w":0.31724029541015619,"h":0.028469908567528068},{"x":0.14620388181922331,"h":0.021325840308293098,"y":0.25685755353710893,"w":0.28649431864420571,"t":"How would we know where to go?","c":1},{"w":0.62909291585286464,"x":0.14417130165549633,"y":0.27263275350634908,"t":"If you check the club website, youll see that the route for each ride is clearly","h":0.035854832095940203,"c":1},{"t":"marked. So you can just print that out and take it along with you. It's similar from","w":0.65519531250000007,"x":0.14434878405712795,"y":0.29019262935567192,"h":0.035318846251223057,"c":1},{"t":"one week to another, but it's not always exactly the same.","x":0.14428249321733888,"y":0.30769761805154672,"h":0.030663081928751668,"w":0.48052444458007815,"c":1},{"h":0.019045554048694235,"t":"And what do I need to bring?","w":0.24484491984049481,"y":0.32859778839217002,"c":1,"x":0.14262559736901101},{"c":1,"w":0.6344849141438802,"y":0.34501829101072778,"t":"Well, bring a bottle of water, and your phone. You shouldn't use it while you're","x":0.14236688915191945,"h":0.032507393487560599},{"h":0.017494272279954259,"y":0.36627906961468759,"c":1,"x":0.14285714652376999,"t":"cycling, but have it with you.","w":0.2387217966715495},{"h":0.015988372635703185,"c":1,"y":0.38372092992790907,"t":"Right.","x":0.14473684262880407,"w":0.046992479960123706},{"c":1,"y":0.39786875252862752,"x":0.14053186843249088,"t":"And in winter, it's well before sunrise when we set out, so you need to make sure","h":0.032777635189923604,"w":0.66077021280924475},{"t":"your bike's got lights.","x":0.14080650021399227,"y":0.4188694518364352,"c":1,"h":0.017276148602644703,"w":0.17897205352783202},{"c":1,"t":"That's OK. Well, thanks Jim. I'd definitely like to join. So what's the best way of","x":0.14250083873147257,"y":0.43520764238319387,"w":0.64346725463867183,"h":0.027538063751829878},{"w":0.12593985239664715,"h":0.016097875080489432,"t":"going about it?","c":1,"y":0.45492594983176526,"x":0.14097744206496857},{"c":1,"h":0.019097885775397172,"t":"You can ...","y":0.47149018248339081,"x":0.13991217221273117,"w":0.090491822560628266},{"c":1,"t":"Q7","w":0.031954886118571002,"h":0.014534883321060788,"y":0.13953488386030299,"x":0.84210526360581484},{"t":"Q8","x":0.84022556394127301,"w":0.026315789222717267,"y":0.2252906978137913,"h":0.014534883321060788,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883321060788,"t":"Q9","c":1,"y":0.29360465129005098,"x":0.83646616506602967,"w":0.028195489247639927},{"x":0.071064125852820278,"c":1,"w":0.15111855824788406,"t":"SECTION 2","y":0.52717867539356922,"h":0.020682755548264709},{"t":"Thanks for coming everyone. OK, so this meeting is for new staff and staff who haven't been","y":0.56097641420505262,"w":0.74098124186197922,"x":0.071198717786756072,"h":0.023993632751975746,"c":1},{"x":0.067376481738415733,"y":0.5769143433355769,"w":0.74487808227539065,"h":0.027291380814099764,"c":1,"t":"involved with our volunteering projects yet. So basically, the idea is that we allow staff to give"},{"w":0.73900085449218744,"h":0.021381469058437741,"t":"up some of their work time to help on various charity projects to benefit the local community.","y":0.59732634881141367,"x":0.069399214455136943,"c":1},{"x":0.069316023888685935,"y":0.61324143697702005,"w":0.59628428141276035,"t":"We've been doing this for the last five years and it's been very successful.","h":0.024170838090119218,"c":1},{"t":"Participating doesn't necessarily involve a huge time commitment. The company will pay for","x":0.069329591337244478,"h":0.026424309705352367,"w":0.7372396341959635,"y":0.63798912395340912,"c":1},{"y":0.65540071105519804,"h":0.026399704539537883,"c":1,"t":"eight hours of your time. That can be used over one or two days all at once, or spread over","x":0.069330019593800779,"w":0.72782180786132811},{"y":0.67583312578720811,"w":0.72191380818684903,"h":0.021373623505915984,"t":"several months throughout the year. There are some staff who enjoy volunteering so much","c":1,"x":0.069479993245809057},{"y":0.690348840604321,"c":1,"t":"they also give up their own free time for a couple of hours every week. It's completely up to","h":0.025604036801565977,"w":0.72402247111002604,"x":0.069330606368931458},{"t":"you. Obviously, many people will have family commitments and aren't as available as other","h":0.023172161153878101,"w":0.72755035400390622,"x":0.067605558552141648,"y":0.70919794513528711,"c":1},{"y":0.72443532500515406,"x":0.068482259710824306,"w":0.13762959798177082,"c":1,"h":0.023133621166693485,"t":"members of staff."},{"t":"Feedback from staff has been overwhelmingly positive. Because they felt they were","x":0.069314221780596527,"w":0.66577840169270841,"h":0.026932588025821991,"y":0.74992471762432877,"c":1},{"h":0.026766016187010799,"w":0.70136805216471343,"t":"doing something really useful, nearly everyone agreed that volunteering made them reel","y":0.76739424995456584,"x":0.069391010841701573,"c":1},{"x":0.069548872277931037,"w":0.70676691691080729,"c":1,"y":0.78622021867073,"t":"more motivated at work. They also liked building relationships with the people in the local","h":0.02482629298242689},{"t":"community and felt valued by them. One or two people also said it was a good thing to have","x":0.069512612599704746,"h":0.026845487409150826,"y":0.80224173616079963,"w":0.72568471272786461,"c":1},{"x":0.067640774362068751,"c":1,"h":0.025870822432420448,"t":"on their CVs.","y":0.81684142436736185,"w":0.10399841944376628},{"w":0.71052632649739578,"t":"One particularly successful project last year was the Get Working Project. This was aimed","y":0.8444767444394331,"h":0.027706127817678339,"c":1,"x":0.069548866732505085},{"h":0.028446121363200683,"c":1,"x":0.069506906038346111,"t":"at helping unemployed people in the area get back to work. Our staff were able to help them","y":0.8603720194216683,"w":0.72757171630859374},{"h":0.029725504013621507,"c":1,"y":0.8763280135351118,"t":"improve their telephone skills, such as writing down messages and speaking with confidence","x":0.069501603463988315,"w":0.73321528116861989},{"c":1,"x":0.069548883559239841,"h":0.026400515132002589,"y":0.896651641465392,"w":0.65601501464843759,"t":"to potential customers, which they had found quite difficult. This is something hinkiy"},{"w":0.71649322509765623,"c":1,"x":0.069438496066466376,"h":0.032246259896891782,"y":0.90961703287026463,"t":"employers look for in job applicants - and something we all do without even thinking about,"},{"y":0.92947034259704919,"h":0.030436808726746145,"t":"every day at work.","x":0.067080899339421809,"w":0.14533690134684246,"c":1},{"y":0.75145348853165295,"c":1,"h":0.014534883321060788,"t":"Q12","w":0.037593984603881858,"x":0.82142857151384852},{"h":0.014534883321060788,"c":1,"t":"Q13","x":0.81578947337421726,"y":0.85901162806416176,"w":0.03571428616841632}],"h":3106}